🔄 5. Auto-Fill Lookup via Call Sign
Use an API (like HamQTH, QRZ, or callook.info) to:

Auto-fill name, QTH, grid square, DXCC.

Optionally cache previous lookups in DB.

📡 6. Live Spotting / Cluster Integration
Display recent DX spots.

Suggest call signs to chase that you haven’t worked before.

🧾 7. Printable QSL Cards or Labels
Generate a printable card/label (PDF) for each QSO or batch.

Include station info, RST, frequency, and a custom logo.

📊 8. Advanced Statistics
Charts for:

QSOs by band/mode over time.

Countries/DXCC entities worked/confirmed.

Daily/weekly logging habits.

🛠️ 9. Settings Panel
Let user customize:

Default mode/frequency.

Preferred sort order.

Theme (dark/light).

Display callsign aliases.

🔁 10. API Support
Provide JSON/REST endpoints for:

Listing QSOs.

Submitting QSOs.

Map data.


